{"id":"dae2ebe8bc9eb6b4","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-principal-function.md","title":"无限集合的主函数","display":"df-principal-function — 无限集合的主函数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-principal-function","aliases":["43-df-principal-function"],"display":"df-principal-function — 无限集合的主函数","depends_on":[],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§5.14, principal function before Lemma 5.14.4","source_printed_pages":"59","source_pdf_pages":"79","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"revision_round":"2026-10-15-round2"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-principal-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-principal-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-principal-function — 无限集合的主函数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§5.14, principal function before Lemma 5.14.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"59"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"79"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-15-round2"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|=\\infty\">\\(|A|=\\infty\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_A\">\\(p_A\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span>，值域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p_A(n)\\coloneqq\\min\\{a\\in A:|\\{b\\in A:b&lt;a\\}|=n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p_A(n)\\coloneqq\\min\\{a\\in A:|\\{b\\in A:b&lt;a\\}|=n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>无限自然数子集在自然数良序下有唯一递增枚举，每个输入n都有唯一的第n个元素；n从0开始，a=0时前面的区间为空。有限A不在本函数的声明域内。</p>\n<p>来源：所供2007-07-28草稿，§5.14, principal function before Lemma 5.14.4，印刷页59，PDF页79。核对了来源陈述；未将来源完整证明标记为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"|A|=\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"p_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"p_A(n)\\coloneqq\\min\\{a\\in A:|\\{b\\in A:b<a\\}|=n\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1221,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-87","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-principal-function]] — 无限集合的主函数"},{"id":"a09ec8a13786db93","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ 且 $|A|=\\infty$。$p_A$、$\\operatorname{HyperimmuneSet}$、$\\le^*$、$\\operatorname{TotalComputable}$ 分别采用 [[43-df-principal-function]]、[[43-df-hyperimmune-set]]、[[43-df-domination]]、[[43-df-computable]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}